## Context

Once design is locked (ticket 0175), run the full sweep:
9 models × 5 repeats = 45 runs, temperature=0, base.txt prompt.

## Actions

1. Confirm preflight passes: `make -C experiments preflight`
2. Run: `make -C experiments sweep_ablation_p1_direct_base`
   (or the upgraded sweep name if renamed in 0175)
3. Monitor for refusals, parse errors, truncation — record counts in log
4. Run `make -C experiments rebuild-measurements` to ingest results
5. Spot-check 3 runs manually: one high-F1, one low-F1, one refusal/error

## Exit criteria

- [ ] 45 run files in `experiments/outputs/ablation/direct/p1_base/`
- [ ] All runs in `measurements.jsonl` with `prompt_version = "p1_base"`
- [ ] Refusal/error count logged here
- [ ] Spot-check passed (3 runs reviewed)
